        "action": "Hold a referendum on whether to mandate a general election when the PM changes",
        "additional_details": "We believe that a politician who did not lead a party at general election time should not be able to make decisions for the people. ",
        "background": "Give the British people the vote in a referendum to decide if a general election should be mandated when the Prime Minister changes between general elections.",
